    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High in the skies, you take flight in a legendary WWI biplane, the wind whipping through your hair as the propeller spins. But this is no ordinary dogfight. It\u2019s a clash of eras, where the past and future collide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical Showdowns: Engage in thrilling skirmishes against enemy planes from different time periods. From the nimble PT-17 to the sleek F-16 Fighting Falcon, every dogfight is a battle across the ages.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold and Glory: When your biplane takes a hit, fear not! Collect gold during each aerial duel, and use it to upgrade to more modern aircraft. Will you choose the agile Messerschmitt or the cutting-edge F-18 Hornet? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization Galore: Outfit your planes with air-to-air missiles, gunpods, and other advanced weaponry. Turn your vintage warbird into a high-tech marvel, ready to dominate the skies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, buckle up, pilot! The skies await, and history is your battleground. Rise above the clouds, defy time, and become a legend in Time of War - Airstrike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Should work with Playstation controllers, but not guaranteed functional yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Game works offline, but needs 1 minute of being online to authentic with steam prior to going offline.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High in the skies, you take flight in a legendary WWI biplane, the wind whipping through your hair as the propeller spins. But this is no ordinary dogfight. It\u2019s a clash of eras, where the past and future collide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical Showdowns: Engage in thrilling skirmishes against enemy planes from different time periods. From the nimble PT-17 to the sleek F-16 Fighting Falcon, every dogfight is a battle across the ages.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold and Glory: When your biplane takes a hit, fear not! Collect gold during each aerial duel, and use it to upgrade to more modern aircraft. Will you choose the agile Messerschmitt or the cutting-edge F-18 Hornet? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization Galore: Outfit your planes with air-to-air missiles, gunpods, and other advanced weaponry. Turn your vintage warbird into a high-tech marvel, ready to dominate the skies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, buckle up, pilot! The skies await, and history is your battleground. Rise above the clouds, defy time, and become a legend in Time of War - Airstrike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Should work with Playstation controllers, but not guaranteed functional yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Game works offline, but needs 1 minute of being online to authentic with steam prior to going offline.</p>",
